hen 97 \\\"\n         \\\"inversions, and the no-delay case produced none in either run. These counts are properties of this harness's \\\"\n         \\\"delay distribution, not a field rate, and a rate below one in two hundred remains undetected for the \\\"\n         \\\"no-delay case.\\\")\nassert old_lim in new['limitations']\nnew['limitations']=[new_lim if l==old_lim else l for l in new['limitations']]\nnew['joint_history']=new['joint_history']+(\\\" Receipt b89fc1d89b434e8c84a2219073e9a01c is a repeat execution of the same \\\"\n  \\\"fixed experiment with the same saved inputs, run in a clean copy; it adds reproducibility under the exercised delay \\\"\n  \\\"distribution and does not introduce a different basis.\\\")\njson.dump({'rationale':(\\\"Add the repeat receipt to the heartbeat account: the fixed experiment reproduced its pair, with \\\"\n  \\\"0 inversions in the no-delay case and 97 of 200 in the jittered case against 90 in the first run. The limitation now \\\"\n  \\\"states both runs and keeps the caveat that these counts describe the harness's delay distribution, not a field rate.\\\"),\n 'interpretations':[new]},open('draft/update.json','w'),indent=2)\nprint('ce',len(new['counterevidence']),'lim',len(new['limitations']))\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-17_17-50-22-hashicorp_raft-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | tail -3\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
